@YourArc_HostAddress = http://localhost:5103

### Health Check (Render keep-alive)
GET {{YourArc_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Root
GET {{YourArc_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### Register User
POST {{YourArc_HostAddress}}/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login User
POST {{YourArc_HostAddress}}/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

